{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAMH - Path to Serenity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/9f20ec6a585145f1a1309c1582b733e3.avif?t=1757927077\" width=618 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Game Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path to Serenity is a cozy walking simulator that takes players on a heartfelt journey in the shoes of Jim, a man torn between career ambitions and the family he\u2019s drifting away from. As the pressures of work mount, he realises he\u2019s losing more than he\u2019s gaining. Guided by his aunt Didi\u2019s advice, an unexpected trip leads him to her cabin\u2014where he may finally rediscover the path he was meant to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/c1c7463bc2367a8bfa4b60a6de4ae495.avif?t=1757927077\" width=618 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxation Mode:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you can simply explore the forest level at your own pace, taking in the ambient sounds and calming music. Wander through the areas Jim once explored, now quiet and peaceful. There are no objectives\u2014just walking, unwinding, and enjoying the atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope this mode offers you a happy place to relax and recharge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calm, exploration and relaxing experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Overall objective &amp; length:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Path to Serenity</i> is a short, calming experience with no dangers, timers, or difficulty. Players can explore at their own pace, guiding Jim on his journey of self-discovery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/bf24c8db19081914b47503f6206c9d4e.poster.avif?t=1757927077\" width=618 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/bf24c8db19081914b47503f6206c9d4e.webm?t=1757927077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/bf24c8db19081914b47503f6206c9d4e.mp4?t=1757927077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is approximately one hour long and can be completed in a single sitting or at a relaxed pace over time.\u00a0With soothing music, nice crafted levels, ambient soundscapes, and peaceful areas to pause and reflect, both Jim and players can find a sense of calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storytelling through colour:</strong><br>The story unfolds through colour, reflecting Jim\u2019s emotions\u2014melancholic blues at home, dull grays in his joyless office, and increasingly vibrant tones as he embraces a new path in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Progression &amp; Interaction:</strong><br>Players help Jim by completing simple tasks like making lunch, doing chores, and interacting with colleagues. The story is further enriched through interactive elements scattered throughout the world, as well as dialogue with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/2e33a27e9844f88b3ff03e4f849d81d4.poster.avif?t=1757927077\" width=618 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/2e33a27e9844f88b3ff03e4f849d81d4.webm?t=1757927077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/2e33a27e9844f88b3ff03e4f849d81d4.mp4?t=1757927077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/dbe6bb18d4c2524431c084759f553b9f.poster.avif?t=1757927077\" width=618 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/dbe6bb18d4c2524431c084759f553b9f.webm?t=1757927077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/dbe6bb18d4c2524431c084759f553b9f.mp4?t=1757927077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About my studio project and me:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/extras/32721289ac56ad8b2d1f2277cd1bf790.avif?t=1757927077\" width=618 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3265030?t=1757927077","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757927077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/61c158f92e1969b076b0830a6d4663768f3e173c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757927077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265030/61c158f92e1969b076b0830a6d4663768f3e173c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757927077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAMH - Path